{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18676","headline":"从崔中丞过卢少尹郊居 · 柳宗元","name":"从崔中丞过卢少尹郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寓居湘岸四无邻，世网难婴每自珍。\n莳药闲庭延国老，开罇虚室值贤人。\n泉回浅石依高柳，迳转垂藤闲绿筠。\n闻道偏爲五禽戏，出门鸥鸟更相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}